 "applies_to": "Daikin Applied Europe Modular T (ATB) air handling units with the MODULAR T controller software.",
 "summary": "The Modular T (ATB) air handler controller takes a POL908 module for BACnet IP or a POL904 module for BACnet MS/TP. The list covers outdoor, supply, return and exhaust temperatures, filter and fan pressures, humidity, CO2 and IEQ sensors, damper, fan, coil and humidifier signals, temperature, humidity, flow and pressure setpoints, defrost settings, switch and alarm inputs, outputs and a unit status BMS command. Object instances are fixed but non-sequential.",
