  "BACnet IP",
  "BACnet MS/TP"
 ],
 "firmware": null,
 "default_device_instance": null,
 "access_inferred": false,
 "notes": [
  "Which objects exist depends on the AHU configuration (optional sensors, pre/post coils, humidifier, recovery).",
  "AV 30549 RecvMulDfrsEval has no description in the guide.",
  "MV 16534 UnitStatusBMS is printed without state texts.",
  "CoHeSwtc is printed as both BI 54908 and BO 54908.",
  "The guide's alarm section refers to AlmOutHigh, AlmCl0-3 and AckAlmPls, which are not in this object list; the list's general alarm output is BO 48570 GlblAlrmSwtc.",
  "Daikin France (Easyspec) publishes this guide as a PDF inside a zip together with the Modbus guide."
 ],
